I believe this fix is closely related to this issue - https://github.com/google/flatbuffers/issues/5032

Basically it fixes following case:
```
namespace OtherCompany;

table A {
   N: int;
}

namespace MyCompany;

table B {
   nested_A: [ubyte] (nested_flatbuffer: "OtherCompany.A");
}

root_type B;
```

Otherwise lookup will be by fully qualified name `MyCompany.OtherCompany.A` and to nobody’s surprise there is no such struct.

